n","html":"声明、类型、绑定、递归及书内链接审查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n}\">\\(w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau]\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"92256ad8556a5baf\" href=\"?note=92256ad8556a5baf\" title=\"29-df-bool-query\">29-df-bool-query</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BIT}\">\\(\\mathrm{BIT}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_n^{\\leq,\\mathrm{BIT}}\">\\(\\mathfrak N_n^{\\leq,\\mathrm{BIT}}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9f29a2487393d5b9\" href=\"?note=9f29a2487393d5b9\" title=\"29-df-bit\">29-df-bit</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ca637fd445ff9abd\" href=\"?note=ca637fd445ff9abd\" title=\"29-df-numeric-structures\">29-df-numeric-structures</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 在载集位置表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\">\\([n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w:[n]\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(w:[n]\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 遍历下式的两个词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A_w^\\tau\">\\(\\mathfrak A_w^\\tau\\)</span> 由下式分情况定义，不把词汇参数与名称上标默认为同一记号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{&lt;,S}\\coloneqq\\langle&lt;^{(2)},S^{(1)}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary},\\qquad\n\\tau_{&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT},S}\\coloneqq\\langle&lt;^{(2)},\\mathrm{BIT}^{(2)},S^{(1)}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau_{&lt;,S}\\coloneqq\\langle&lt;^{(2)},S^{(1)}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary},\\qquad\n\\tau_{&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT},S}\\coloneqq\\langle&lt;^{(2)},\\mathrm{BIT}^{(2)},S^{(1)}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{n}\\coloneqq\\{(i,j)\\in n^2\\mid i&lt;j\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[&lt;_{n}\\coloneqq\\{(i,j)\\in n^2\\mid i&lt;j\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_w\\coloneqq\\{i\\in n\\mid w(i)=1\\},\\qquad\n\\mathfrak A_w^{&lt;,S}\\coloneqq\\langle n,&lt;_{n},S_w\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_{&lt;,S}]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_w\\coloneqq\\{i\\in n\\mid w(i)=1\\},\\qquad\n\\mathfrak A_w^{&lt;,S}\\coloneqq\\langle n,&lt;_{n},S_w\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_{&lt;,S}]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A_w^{&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT},S}\\coloneqq\n\\langle n,&lt;_{n},\\mathrm{BIT}_{n},S_w\\rangle\n\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_{&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT},S}]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A_w^{&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT},S}\\coloneqq\n\\langle n,&lt;_{n},\\mathrm{BIT}_{n},S_w\\rangle\n\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_{&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT},S}]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A_w^\\tau\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathfrak A_w^{&lt;,S},&amp;\\tau=\\tau_{&lt;,S},\\\\\\mathfrak A_w^{&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT},S},&amp;\\tau=\\tau_{&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT},S}.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A_w^\\tau\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathfrak A_w^{&lt;,S},&amp;\\tau=\\tau_{&lt;,S},\\\\\\mathfrak A_w^{&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT},S},&amp;\\tau=\\tau_{&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT},S}.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Lang}_{\\tau}(Q)\\coloneqq\n\\{w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{+}\\mid\\mathfrak A_w^{\\tau}\\in Q\\},\n\\qquad\nQ\\in\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau],\\quad\n\\tau\\in\\{\\tau_{&lt;,S},\\tau_{&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT},S}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Lang}_{\\tau}(Q)\\coloneqq\n\\{w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{+}\\mid\\mathfrak A_w^{\\tau}\\in Q\\},\n\\qquad\nQ\\in\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau],\\quad\n\\tau\\in\\{\\tau_{&lt;,S},\\tau_{&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT},S}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>词汇参数化的上标别名不增加任何结构解释，只显式连接原有两种词结构接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-numeric-structures","status":"resolved","id":"ca637fd445ff9abd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-numeric-structures]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · 